FINAL ENTERPRISE-LEVEL SUMMARY

Application Insights is Azure’s application observability platform
used for monitoring distributed applications, APIs, dependencies, exceptions, and 
end-user experience. In enterprise environments it integrates with OpenTelemetry, 
AKS, Log Analytics, and Azure Monitor to provide deep visibility into application performance, request flows, and dependency health, helping SRE teams reduce MTTR and improve reliability.
